        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Municipal waste incineration plant
Swiss municipal waste incineration plant with 100'000 ton per year capacity. Operational time 40 years;
Synonyms: MSWI, KVA; 
UUID: c48dd908-0b49-323f-8270-ef772e7c900d
construction and disposal of municipal waste incineration plant, land use exchanges.
Location: Technology encountered in Switzerland. Well applicable to modern grate incinerators. 
Technology: Municipal soild waste incineration plant with waste bunker, grate incinerator, steam boiler, electrostatic precipitator, wet scrubber.
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: Data from literature and estimates. 
Extrapolations: &lt;null&gt;
Uncertainty adjustments: &lt;null&gt;
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_c48dd908-0b49-323f-8270-ef772e7c900d.xml</text>
